From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: coldpath <coldpath@localhost>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 14:42:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Search through the store-bufferpool directory

coldpath harness (user decision: the bufferpool is the baseline). -dirImpl BufferPoolDirectory opens the index and the taxonomy through the OpenSearch store-bufferpool plugin's directory (the plugin jar unchanged, built by a shim in its package; called by reflection, so luceneutil compiles without it). The strict cold mode also waits for prefetch to finish, clears the block cache and requires 0 cached blocks before every task, records the bufferpool counters before and after the task, and traces every device read of the task (-Dcoldpath.cold.trace=nfs|block). The cold reset reopens the taxonomy with the JVM's directory implementation.
---
 src/main/perf/ColdpathBufferPool.java | 77 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/main/perf/ColdpathCold.java       | 31 ++++++++++-
 src/main/perf/IndexState.java         |  7 +--
 src/main/perf/OpenDirectory.java      | 26 ++++++++-
 4 files changed, 135 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/main/perf/ColdpathBufferPool.java

diff --git a/src/main/perf/ColdpathBufferPool.java b/src/main/perf/ColdpathBufferPool.java
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..e0c4d7b3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/main/perf/ColdpathBufferPool.java
@@ -0,0 +1,77 @@
+package perf;
+
+/**
